@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
title List pending student invitations
actor Tutor
participant "Pending invitations API" as Api
participant "GetPendingStudentInvitationsHandler" as Handler
database "SQL Server" as Db

Tutor -> Api: GET /api/tutors/me/student-invitations
alt Missing or invalid authentication
  Api --> Tutor: 401 Unauthorized
else Caller lacks the Tutor role
  Api --> Tutor: 403 Forbidden
else Authenticated tutor
  Api -> Handler: Query for account from JWT sub
  Handler -> Db: Read owned Created or Sent invitations\nwith validity later than current UTC time
  Db --> Handler: Display metadata, newest first
  Handler --> Api: PendingStudentInvitationResponse[]
  Api --> Tutor: 200 OK
end
@enduml
